_the_ISS_3.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png/500px-2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png/1280px-2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png/500px-2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The North American blizzard of 2006, an extratropical storm, showed an eye-like structure at its peak intensity.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2006_North_American_blizzard_February_12_1245z.png"}],"sounds":{}}}